    {
      "path": "pfp/tests/sn/test_sn_e2e_normal_form_evaluation.py",
      "sha256": "66bdf7296817c8515c4fa5421b141d8f96ee1c6ed2e2ccefb6c8e2c0184d680e",
      "full_source_read": true,
      "reviewed_lines": [
        [
          1,
          521
        ]
      ],
      "line_count": 521,
      "empty_file_read": false,
      "assessment": "Full521lines read. Five local-to-canonical route families exercised with constructed flags/scalars/strings: irreflexivity plus witness weights, certified_fold and equal regime names, tied-candidate counts, authority URI/confidence and lineage/source-fact names. Tests validate routing according to supplied metadata, not recomputed folds/minima/actual provenance or verified authority. Recompute and Escalate local routes intentionally map to admitted Preserve. Exhaustive wording exceeds enforcement: declared_routes equals route_map keys but observed routes are not accumulated/compared, so an added route in both declarations may remain untested. Convenience parity test checks constants only, not paired instance equality. Unsupported-contract docstring says ValueError while assertion expects FileNotFoundError. No runtime invoked.",
